@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@ownerId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001

### Get admin dashboard
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reporting/dashboard
Accept: application/json

###

### Get daily booking statistics
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reporting/daily-stats?from=2026-11-01&to=2026-11-10
Accept: application/json

###

### Get owner revenue report
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reporting/owner/revenue?ownerId={{ownerId}}&month=11&year=2026
Accept: application/json
